:{"text":"그 뒤를 이어, 실벤 역시 포탈에서 걸어 나왔다","source_cn":"紧接着，休也走了出来","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C948A0400902E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1610435010:1":{"text":"피파, 우리가 얼마나 걱정했는 줄 알아!? 그런데 세 번째 섬에서는 드디어 실력을 발휘한 거구나! 너희도 마지막에 날아다니는 마물을 만났지?","source_cn":"皮帕，前两场考试我们都很担心你，没想到第三场你就爆发出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E2F81362D4E655D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1610435011:1":{"text":"응, 맞아.","source_cn":"嗯，我的是飞行魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4ACBB28745504545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1610435012:1":{"text":"나도. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 그렇지?","source_cn":"我的也是，想必<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8163A1D6412E0C0A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 그렇지?","female":"나도. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 그렇지?","variant_male_record_index":"203898","variant_female_record_index":"203899","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1610435012":{"text":"나도. <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 너도 그렇지?","source_cn":"我的也是，想必<style=stress><player_name></style>的也一样吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8163A1D6412E0C0A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나도. <style=\"s